744
01:28:33,433 --> 01:28:34,066
Itu

745
01:28:34,100 --> 01:28:34,766
Heihu

746
01:28:34,800 --> 01:28:36,300
Bagaimana kalau kamu yang
mengatur transportasi para pekerja?

747
01:28:36,366 --> 01:28:36,666
Aku

748
01:28:37,100 --> 01:28:38,233
