760
01:28:55,100 --> 01:28:55,466
Jenderal Xie.

761
01:28:55,933 --> 01:28:56,266
Begini saja

762
01:28:56,800 --> 01:28:57,733
Soal pengangkutan rampasan perang

763
01:28:58,033 --> 01:28:58,866
aku akan menugaskan orang untuk mengawasinya untukmu

764
01:28:59,366 --> 01:28:59,933
Kau tinggal merampas

765
01:29:00,300 --> 01:29:01,600
Kalau kau bawa pulang, banyak orang
yang akan mengangkutnya untukmu.

766
01:29:03,400 --> 01:29:04,066
Kalau begitu semuanya beres.

767
01:29:05,933 --> 01:29:07,366
Karena Inspektur Patroli Yang mengurus transportasi,

768
01:29:07,766 --> 01:29:08,266
Changfeng

769
01:29:08,800 --> 01:29:09,766
Kamu yang pilih orangnya

770
01:29:11,100 --> 01:29:11,533
Yue Wu

771
01:29:11,733 --> 01:29:12,066
Wang Gui

772
01:29:12,200 --> 01:29:12,533
Li Kui

773
01:29:12,866 --> 01:29:13,233
Ikut aku

774
01:29:15,633 --> 01:29:16,000
Saya bersedia pergi

775
01:29:16,633 --> 01:29:17,366
Aku juga

776
01:29:17,666 --> 01:29:18,133
Aku ikut juga

777
01:29:20,233 --> 01:29:20,500
Baik

778
01:29:20,966 --> 01:29:21,500
Kalau begitu kau ikut juga

779
01:29:25,033 --> 01:29:25,500
Sebelum berangkat

780
01:29:26,033 --> 01:29:26,966
periksa dulu Yeli Dian baik-baik

781
01:29:27,866 --> 01:29:29,133
Tanyakan dengan jelas tentang topografi
di sekitar Kota Gunung Roulang,

782
01:29:29,400 --> 01:29:29,766
suku-sukunya,

783
01:29:29,933 --> 01:29:30,266
pos-pos militernya,

784
01:29:30,566 --> 01:29:31,000
tanyakan semuanya dengan jelas.

785
01:29:31,566 --> 01:29:32,133
Sebelum berperang,

786
01:29:32,500 --> 01:29:32,966
