787
01:29:33,900 --> 01:29:34,166
Dan lagi,

788
01:29:34,600 --> 01:29:35,300
Dengarkan lebih banyak pendapat Yue Wu

789
01:29:35,366 --> 01:29:35,800
dan Li Kui

790
01:29:36,166 --> 01:29:36,700
Tenang saja

791
01:29:36,966 --> 01:29:37,666
Aku pasti akan mendengarkan mereka

792
01:29:38,500 --> 01:29:39,466
Kalau mereka tidak mau memberi saran

793
01:29:39,833 --> 01:29:40,666
akan kupukul sampai mereka menurut

